description: Alembic migration standards — reversible, reviewed, fresh-DB verified
globs: apps/api/alembic/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Migrations

- Alembic for all schema changes — no ad-hoc prod DDL as SoT
- Migrations must be reversible (or expand/contract with explicit forward-fix plan)
- Verify on fresh PostgreSQL: upgrade → downgrade → upgrade (replay)
- Invoke **Migration Reviewer** subagent for DDL/RLS/index/constraint changes
- Cite migration head revision in completion evidence
